Bracktracking
---------------
it is also one of the problem solving strategy. this strategy usages brute force approach.


Brute force approach (try out all possible solution and pick up desired solution)


It is not for optimization problem like dynamic programming, backtracking is used when u have multiple solution and u want all those solutions.


branch and bound vs backtracking 
----------------------------------

backtracking follow dfs approach
branch and bound follow bfs approach

